  "$description": "EchoMeBetter design tokens, in the W3C Design Tokens (DTCG) format: every colour, font, shadow, gradient and timing in the UI. Three layers: palette (raw colours, never used by components directly), theme (what a colour is for, per theme; each becomes a CSS variable and a Tailwind colour such as bg-surface or text-fg-muted), and the component recipes in src/ui/components/buttons.ts. A new theme token goes in theme.light and theme.dark (and theme.inverse only if it differs from dark); tokens.cjs resolves the references and src/test/unit/design/tokens.test.ts checks that every theme defines every token.",
